msgid "Navigation Basics"
msgstr "导航基础"

msgid "Tools & Actions"
msgstr "工具 & 操作"

msgid ""
"Open Time Groups: Click on \"Match: (timegroup)\" or \"No Match\" to view "
"details in a new tab."
msgstr ""
"打开时间组：单击 \"匹配：(timegroup)\" 或 \"无匹配\" 以在新标签中查看详细信"
"息。"

msgid "Viewing Controls"
msgstr "查看控制"

msgid "Click graph to zoom"
msgstr "点击图表以放大"

msgid "Keyboard Shortcuts"
msgstr "快捷键"

msgid "Press R to reload the current graph."
msgstr "按R键重新加载当前图表。"

msgid ""
"Use the Left and Right arrow keys to step to the previous or next dial plan."
msgstr "使用左右箭头键跳到前一个或后一个拨号计划。"

msgid "Press ? to jump straight to the Navigation & Usage page."
msgstr "按？键可直接跳转到导航与使用页面。"

msgid ""
"Shortcuts work as soon as the page loads and pause automatically while you "
"are typing, searching, or using a dialog."
msgstr ""
"快捷方式在页面加载时立即生效，并在您正在输入、搜索或使用对话框时自动暂停。"

msgid ""
"The Reload button shows an [R] hint, and the previous/next buttons show their "
"shortcut keys on hover. A full list lives on the Navigation & Usage page."
msgstr ""
"重新加载按钮显示一个[R]提示，而上一页/下一页按钮在悬停时显示它们的快捷键。完整"
"的列表位于“导航与使用”页面上。"

msgid "Graph Navigation"
msgstr "图形导航"

msgid ""
"The mouse wheel scrolls the page as usual until you click the graph to engage "
"zoom. Click anywhere outside the graph to release it and scroll the page "
"again. A brief \"Click graph to zoom\" hint appears if you wheel over the "
"graph before engaging it."
msgstr ""
"鼠标轮滚动页面如同常规操作，直到你点击图表进行放大。点击图表外的任何地方释放它"
"并继续滚动页面。如果在点击图表之前滚动鼠标轮悬停在图表上，会出现一句“点击图表"
"进行放大”的提示。"

msgid "Interface"
msgstr "界面"

msgid ""
"The toolbar now scrolls with the page instead of floating, so it no longer "
"overlaps the graph as you scroll."
msgstr "工具栏现在与页面滚动一起滑动，而不是漂浮，所以它再也不会与图表重叠了。"

msgid "announcement off"
msgstr "宣布关闭"

msgid "Reload the current graph."
msgstr "重载当前图表。"

msgid "Jump to the previous or next dial plan."
msgstr "跳到前一个或下一个拨号计划。"

msgid "Open this Navigation & Usage page."
msgstr "打开此导航与使用页面。"

msgid ""
"Shortcuts pause while typing in a field, searching the dial plan list, or "
"when a dialog is open."
msgstr "快捷键在输入字段、搜索拨号计划列表或打开对话框时暂停。"

msgid "Press F to fit the graph back to the default pan and zoom."
msgstr "按F键以适应图形返回默认面板和缩放。"

msgid ""
"Nodes now have distinct colors where some previously shared the same one."
msgstr "节点现在有独特的颜色，之前某些节点使用了相同的颜色。"

msgid "Open the GitHub repository"
msgstr "打开GitHub仓库"

msgid "Fit the graph: reset pan and zoom to the default view."
msgstr "适应图形：重置滚动条和放大缩小到默认视图。"

msgid "Buy me a coffee"
msgstr "买我一杯咖啡"

msgid ""
"Time Conditions that use a Calendar or Calendar Group now show the calendar "
"name on the Match and No Match arrows again."
msgstr "使用日历或日历组的时间条件现在在匹配和不匹配箭头上 again 显示日历名称。"

msgid ""
"Those arrows are now colored green for the path a call takes right now and "
"red for the path it does not, the same way time group conditions already "
"behaved. They stay black only when the state cannot be determined, such as "
"when the Calendar module is disabled."
msgstr ""
"这些箭头现在根据调用的当前路径显示为绿色，而不是路径的其他部分显示为红色。这与"
"时间组条件的行为保持一致。只有当日历模块被禁用时，箭头才会保持黑色。"

msgid ""
"Simulate Date & Time now evaluates calendars too, so you can check holiday "
"routing before the date arrives."
msgstr ""
"现在模拟日期和时间也可以评估日历，所以你可以在日期到达之前检查节假日路由。"

msgid "Selections %s"
msgstr "选项 %s"

msgid ""
"A Time Condition pointed at a time group with no times defined no longer "
"throws an error. It now shows \"No times defined\" on the arrows and follows "
"No Match, which is what the dial plan actually does."
msgstr ""
"一个时间条件指向一个没有定义时间的时间组overty 已经不再抛出错误。现在在箭头上"
"显示“没有定义时间”，并按照拨号规划实际行为继续进行。"
